---
/**
 * Why22Strong — Section 7: "We know what it's like to fight for care because we've lived it."
 * Layout: Large real photo (left) / copy (right)
 * Mobile: headline → photo → copy
 * Real veteran only. No stock. Travis Mayfield photo already in /public/images/.
 */
---

<section class="w22s" aria-labelledby="w22s-heading">
  <div class="w22s__inner">

    <!-- Photo column — left on desktop, between headline and copy on mobile -->
    <figure class="w22s__figure" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="/images/travis-mayfield.jpg"
        alt=""
        class="w22s__photo"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <!-- Optional secondary: service-era photo of Travis.
           Uncomment and swap src when image is available.
      <div class="w22s__service-era">
        <img
          src="/images/travis-mayfield-service.jpg"
          alt=""
          class="w22s__service-photo"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <span class="w22s__service-caption">101st Airborne Division · Vietnam</span>
      </div>
      -->
    </figure>

    <!-- Copy column -->
    <div class="w22s__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow w22s__eyebrow">Why 22STRONG</p>

      <h2 class="w22s__heading" id="w22s-heading">
        We know what it's like to fight for care because we've lived it.
      </h2>

      <p class="w22s__lead lead">
        22STRONG is led by veterans who understand the system from the inside.
      </p>

      <div class="w22s__body">
        <p>
          Our CEO, Travis Mayfield, is a three-time Purple Heart recipient who has spent
          years navigating care for his own service-related injuries.
        </p>

        <ul class="w22s__beats" role="list">
          <li>He knows what it means to wait.</li>
          <li>To fight for additional treatment.</li>
          <li>
            To be offered another medication when what you really want is the chance
            to get better.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="w22s__close">
          That experience shapes everything we do.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="w22s__signature">
        <p class="w22s__motto">We take care of our own.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="w22s__attribution">
        <img
          src="/images/travis-mayfield.jpg"
          alt="Travis Mayfield"
          class="w22s__avatar"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          width="52"
          height="52"
        />
        <div class="w22s__attr-meta">
          <strong class="w22s__attr-name">Travis Mayfield</strong>
          <span class="w22s__attr-role">
            CEO, 22 Strong Foundation · U.S. Army, 101st Airborne Division
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
